{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Aromatherapy events & mixes</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Practical aromatherapy experiences and custom blends that may support mood and routine. Events, workshops, and personalized plans." />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="/">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
      <nav class="nav">
        <a href="/services.html">What We Do</a>
        <a href="/blends.html">Mixes</a>
        <a href="/shop.html">Apothecary</a>
        <a href="/pricing.html">Investments</a>
        <a href="/about.html">Our Story</a>
        <a href="/book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a href="/contact.html">Reach Out</a>
      </nav>
      <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1>{{TAGLINE}}</h1>
          <p class="sub">Small, clear scent plans for everyday needs — events, short sessions, and DIY blends that may support how you feel.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn" href="/book.html">Reserve a session</a>
            <a class="btn ghost" href="/blends.html">Explore mixes</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-panel">
          <svg class="pattern" width="100%" height="140" viewBox="0 0 600 140" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#g)"/><defs><linearGradient id="g" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#e9f5ef"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#f6faf8"/></linearGradient></defs></svg>
          <div class="panel-content">
            <h3>Upcoming: Open Scent Circle</h3>
            <p class="muted">A guided group session focusing on self-awareness through scent. Limited seats.</p>
            <div class="panel-meta">
              <span>Next: Sat • 10am</span>
              <a class="small" href="/book.html">Join the circle</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="story wrap">
      <div class="col">
        <h2>How we work</h2>
        <p>We create short events and practical take-homes: workshop-style sessions, tailored single visits, and blend cards you can take home. All guidance is safety-forward and informational — essential oils may support mood and routine when used thoughtfully.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <h3>Phone</h3>
        <p><a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></p>
        <h3>Email</h3>
        <p><a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="framework wrap">
      <h2>Session framework</h2>
      <p class="muted">A clear approach so you know what to expect from a session or event.</p>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li><strong>Listen:</strong> brief intake to learn the context and preferences.</li>
        <li><strong>Sample:</strong> smell and discuss curated oils at a table.</li>
        <li><strong>Plan:</strong> a short, practical plan — frequency, format, and blends.</li>
        <li><strong>Takeaway:</strong> a written summary and blend card you can use at home.</li>
      </ol>
      <div class="tools">
        <div class="tool" id="session-planner">
          <h3>Session Planner</h3>
          <p class="muted">Build a short plan and copy a plain-text summary for your records.</p>
          <label>Primary focus</label>
          <select id="sp-focus">
            <option value="calm">Calm / ease tension</option>
            <option value="focus">Focus / clarity</option>
            <option value="sleep">Sleep support</option>
            <option value="uplift">Uplift / energy</option>
            <option value="ritual">Ritual / grounding</option>
          </select>
          <label>Session length</label>
          <select id="sp-length">
            <option value="20">20 minutes</option>
            <option value="45">45 minutes</option>
            <option value="90">90 minutes</option>
          </select>
          <label>Format</label>
          <select id="sp-format">
            <option value="virtual">Virtual</option>
            <option value="in-person">In-person</option>
            <option value="mini">Drop-in consult (15m)</option>
          </select>
          <label>Frequency</label>
          <select id="sp-frequency">
            <option value="one-off">One-off</option>
            <option value="weekly">Weekly</option>
            <option value="monthly">Monthly</option>
          </select>
          <button id="sp-build" class="btn small">Create plan</button>
          <pre id="sp-output" class="output" aria-live="polite"></pre>
          <div class="output-actions">
            <button id="sp-copy" class="btn ghost small">Copy summary</button>
            <a id="sp-book" class="btn small" href="/book.html">Book now</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tool" id="blend-quick">
          <h3>Quick Blend</h3>
          <p class="muted">Pick a vibe and a format to get a simple blend card plus safe dilution guidance.</p>
          <label>Vibe</label>
          <select id="bq-vibe">
            <option value="calm">Calm</option>
            <option value="focus">Focus</option>
            <option value="sleep">Sleep</option>
            <option value="uplift">Uplift</option>
          </select>
          <label>Format</label>
          <select id="bq-format">
            <option value="diffuser">Diffuser</option>
            <option value="roll-on">Roll-on</option>
            <option value="spray">Room spray</option>
          </select>
          <button id="bq-build" class="btn small">Make blend</button>
          <div id="bq-output" class="blend-output"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="tool" id="blend-deep">
          <h3>Deep Mix</h3>
          <p class="muted">Choose a vibe and intensity; receive a more detailed card and dilution table.</p>
          <label>Vibe</label>
          <select id="bd-vibe">
            <option value="calm">Calm</option>
            <option value="focus">Focus</option>
            <option value="sleep">Sleep</option>
            <option value="uplift">Uplift</option>
          </select>
          <label>Intensity</label>
          <select id="bd-intensity">
            <option value="low">Low (gentle)</option>
            <option value="medium">Medium</option>
            <option value="high">High (strong aroma)</option>
          </select>
          <button id="bd-build" class="btn small">Create detailed card</button>
          <div id="bd-output" class="blend-output"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="offers wrap">
      <h2>Offerings</h2>
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Short Consult</h3>
          <p class="muted">20-minute quick intake and a simple blend card you can use at home.</p>
          <div class="price">$45</div>
          <a class="btn" href="/book.html">Reserve</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Guided Session</h3>
          <p class="muted">45-minute guided sampling, planning, and a written plan.</p>
          <div class="price">$95</div>
          <a class="btn" href="/book.html">Reserve</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Workshop Night</h3>
          <p class="muted">Group event that introduces safe use and simple blends — includes take-home card.</p>
          <div class="price">From $25</div>
          <a class="btn" href="/book.html">See dates</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pricing wrap">
      <h2>Program bundles</h2>
      <p class="muted">Packages for ongoing support and regular group events.</p>
      <div class="pricing-grid">
        <div class="plan">
          <h4>Starter</h4>
          <p>2 short consults + 1 custom blend card</p>
          <div class="price">$160</div>
          <a class="btn" href="/pricing.html">Choose</a>
        </div>
        <div class="plan">
          <h4>Steady</h4>
          <p>Monthly session + member-only walk-in circle</p>
          <div class="price">$320 / mo</div>
          <a class="btn" href="/pricing.html">Choose</a>
        </div>
        <div class="plan">
          <h4>Event Pass</h4>
          <p>Five workshop entries to share</p>
          <div class="price">$95</div>
          <a class="btn" href="/pricing.html">Choose</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="testimonials wrap">
      <h2>Notes from participants</h2>
      <blockquote>"Clear, practical, and safe — the blend card made mixing at home simple." — A client</blockquote>
      <blockquote>"The group night reminded me how to pause and choose my scent intentionally." — Someone else</blockquote>
    </section>

    <section class="cta wrap">
      <div class="cta-block">
        <h2>Ready to try a session or create a blend?</h2>
        <p class="muted">Book a reserve or start a quick mix. Sessions are held in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} and online.</p>
        <div class="cta-actions">
          <a class="btn" href="/book.html">Reserve a spot</a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="/blends.html">Explore mixes</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq wrap">
      <h2>Safety & FAQs</h2>
      <h4>Are these medical treatments?</h4>
      <p>No — information and sessions are educational and may support wellbeing. We do not diagnose or treat medical conditions.</p>
      <h4>What about dilution and patch testing?</h4>
      <p>All blend cards show safe dilution ranges and recommend a patch test: apply a small diluted amount to an inner forearm and wait 24 hours. Discontinue if irritation occurs.</p>
      <h4>Pets, pregnancy, and special situations</h4>
      <p>Essential oils can affect pets and people differently. Use caution around cats, dogs, young children, and during pregnancy. Consult a qualified provider for special conditions before use.</p>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="foot-brand">{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Events & mixes in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      <div class="foot-actions">
        <a href="/contact.html">Contact</a>
        <a href="/about.html">About</a>
      </div>
      <small>© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}}. All guidance is informational and safety-focused.</small>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
